{"id":"u105","kelas":"kosa","no":6,"judul":"Tubuh dan Kesehatan","title":"The Body and Health","emoji":"🩺","ringkas":"Anggota tubuh, keluhan sakit, dan di dokter","ready":true,"goals":["mempelajari **anggota tubuh** dan **keluhan sakit**","menjelaskan **gejala** kepada dokter dalam bahasa Inggris","mengenali kata melalui **arti, ejaan, dan pendengaran**","memakai pola *I have a ...* dan *My ... hurts*"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Saat sakit atau di dokter, kamu perlu menyebut bagian tubuh dan keluhan. Pelajari kata-kata berikut dan polanya: **I have a headache**, **My stomach hurts**, **I feel dizzy**."},{"t":"vocab","title":"1. Bagian tubuh","items":[{"en":"head","id":"kepala","ex":"My head hurts."},{"en":"shoulder","id":"bahu","ex":"She carries a bag on her shoulder."},{"en":"elbow","id":"siku","ex":"He hit his elbow on the table."},{"en":"knee","id":"lutut","ex":"My knee hurts when I run."},{"en":"stomach","id":"perut","ex":"My stomach hurts."},{"en":"throat","id":"tenggorokan","ex":"I have a sore throat."},{"en":"back","id":"punggung","ex":"My back hurts after sitting all day."},{"en":"tooth","id":"gigi","ex":"I have a pain in my tooth."}]},{"t":"vocab","title":"2. Keluhan sakit","items":[{"en":"headache","id":"sakit kepala","ex":"I have a headache."},{"en":"toothache","id":"sakit gigi","ex":"He has a toothache."},{"en":"fever","id":"demam","ex":"She has a high fever."},{"en":"cough","id":"batuk","ex":"I have a bad cough."},{"en":"cold","id":"pilek","ex":"I caught a cold."},{"en":"sore","id":"nyeri","ex":"My feet are sore."},{"en":"dizzy","id":"pusing","ex":"I feel dizzy."},{"en":"tired","id":"lelah","ex":"I feel tired today."}]},{"t":"vocab","title":"3. Di dokter","items":[{"en":"doctor","id":"dokter","ex":"The doctor is kind."},{"en":"nurse","id":"perawat","ex":"The nurse took my temperature."},{"en":"medicine","id":"obat","ex":"Take this medicine twice a day."},{"en":"pill","id":"pil / tablet","ex":"Take one pill after dinner."},{"en":"injection","id":"suntikan","ex":"The injection did not hurt."},{"en":"rest","id":"istirahat","ex":"You need to rest."},{"en":"appointment","id":"janji temu","ex":"I have an appointment with the doctor."},{"en":"pharmacy","id":"apotek","ex":"Buy the medicine at the pharmacy."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog: Di dokter","lines":[{"who":"Doctor","en":"Good morning. What is the problem?","id":"Selamat pagi. Apa keluhannya?"},{"who":"Budi","en":"I have a fever and a bad cough.","id":"Saya demam dan batuk parah."},{"who":"Doctor","en":"Do you have a sore throat?","id":"Apakah tenggorokan Anda sakit?"},{"who":"Budi","en":"Yes, and my head hurts too.","id":"Ya, dan kepala saya juga sakit."},{"who":"Doctor","en":"Take this medicine and rest for two days.","id":"Minum obat ini dan istirahat dua hari."},{"who":"Budi","en":"Thank you, Doctor.","id":"Terima kasih, Dokter."}]},{"t":"tip","title":"Cara menghafal","text":"Belajar sambil menyentuh: sentuh bagian tubuhmu sambil menyebut namanya (*head, shoulder, knee*). Cara fisik ini membuat kata lebih melekat."},{"t":"summary","items":["Bagian tubuh: [[head]], [[shoulder]], [[elbow]], [[knee]], [[stomach]], [[throat]].","Keluhan sakit: [[headache]], [[toothache]], [[fever]], [[cough]], [[cold]], [[sore]].","Di dokter: [[doctor]], [[nurse]], [[medicine]], [[pill]], [[injection]], [[rest]]."]}],"practice":[{"type":"mcq","q":"Apa arti \"head\"?","options":["kepala","pil / tablet","pilek","perut"],"answer":0,"exp":"head = kepala.","k":"aabc4f16"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata Inggris untuk \"kepala\" adalah...","options":["head","shoulder","fever","nurse"],"answer":0,"exp":"kepala = head.","k":"e47b5e68"},{"type":"fill","id":"Isi dengan kata Inggris untuk \"kepala\":","q":"My ___ hurts.","answers":["head","head"],"hint":"h _ _ _","exp":"kepala = head.","k":"1ae409da"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Apa arti \"shoulder\"?","options":["bahu","pil / tablet","batuk","demam"],"answer":0,"exp":"shoulder = bahu.","k":"d762d945"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata Inggris untuk \"bahu\" ad